    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>空格全部移到了串前的字符串。如：<span></span><span>□</span><span>□abc</span></p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "空格全部移到了串前的字符串。如：□□abc"
    },
